            "text": "<h2>Bakery Gifts Shipped Nationwide — From Charlotte's Sunflour</h2><p>Sunflour Baking Company has been baking from scratch in Charlotte, NC since 2009. Our bakery gifts collection brings that same scratch-made quality to your gift-giving: real baked goods, made by real bakers, packaged for the person on the receiving end — not the shelf.</p><p>Our gift range covers every occasion and every relationship: cake jars for the person who deserves something special, cookie boxes for the office, brownie gifts for the chocolate lover, pastry pouches for a quick thoughtful send, and sampler boxes when you can't pick just one thing. Everything ships nationwide and arrives in packaging that feels like a gift, not a grocery order.</p><h3>What Makes a Sunflour Bakery Gift Different</h3><p>Most gifting options are either too generic or too perishable to ship reliably. Sunflour has spent years figuring out how to get scratch-made baked goods to your recipient in the same condition they leave our kitchen. We use insulated packaging, careful sealing, and intentional box design to protect what's inside.</p><p>Every item in this collection is baked fresh to order in small batches, without mixes or artificial preservatives. The shelf life is real but not indefinite — typically 7-10 days for most items — which is what you'd expect from actual baked goods.</p><h3>Bakery Gift Options From Sunflour</h3><ul><li>Cake jars in six flavors — ships nationwide, no mess</li><li>Cookie gift boxes — multiple sizes and assortments</li><li>Brownie and bar boxes — vegan options available</li><li>Pastry pouches — occasion themes for specific messages</li><li>Sampler boxes — variety packs for groups and households</li><li>Charlotte pickup available at five locations</li></ul>"
